    <Major></Major>
    <Description>CUSTOMIZE MACROS from Josh



For the correct settings
:
Controls "Mouse sensitivity" - 1.0, Options "Field of view" / FOV - 75

FOV 75 - Sensetivity 1.0
FOV 80 - Sensetivity 0.94
FOV 85 - Sensetivity 0.88
FOV 90 - Sensetivity 0.82

Crouch for semi/automatic and m249

Command console F1 - "input.sensitivity 0.8"
Setting sights - for example handmade scope to resize sensitivity lower
Installation of modules influencing the recoil, adjust the Sens
the change
of the recoil - pulls down lower the Sensitivity, or pulls up raise Sensitivity
</Description>
